---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
---

<LegalPage title="Privacy policy">
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>
    Only what the site needs to work: your email address if you subscribe to the newsletter, and the contents of the
    contact form if you write to us. Nothing else is asked for and nothing is sold.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    Page views, likes and downloads are counted per pattern. These counters are anonymous — we store a short,
    irreversible hash derived from your request so the same visitor is not counted twice, and never the address itself.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
  <p>
    No tracking cookies. Your browser stores which patterns you liked so the heart stays filled when you return; that
    value never leaves your device.
  </p>

  <h2>Where the data lives</h2>
  <p>
    Subscriber records and pattern statistics are stored in a Cloudflare D1 database. Pattern files are stored in
    Cloudflare R2. Both are hosted on Cloudflare's network.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    Every newsletter contains a one-click unsubscribe link. Write to us at any time and we will delete your record.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
